{% layout 'subscription-portal' %}
{%- comment -%}
  VetPets Subscription Portal.

  Template suffix: subscription-portal
  Intended page:   /pages/subscriptions  (handle "subscriptions")

  The page itself is deliberately NOT created or published yet — see the
  handoff notes. On the development theme this template is reachable on
  any existing page with ?view=subscription-portal, which keeps the
  portal completely unreachable from the live storefront.

  Uses layout/subscription-portal.liquid so no global theme header,
  navigation or footer is rendered.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% section 'subscription-portal' %}
